  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Stolen unrestrained heavenly marks form a heaven path immortal material. Fang Yuan takes that material and activates a food path killer move, Devour Heaven and Earth. The killer move is his gain from recent cultivation. His food path attainment level is grandmaster. He has countless food path killer moves and deep wisdom path attainment, and creating a killer move to devour heaven path immortal materials is not difficult for him.",
