      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After consuming this heaven path immortal material, Fang Yuan’s sovereign immortal aperture gains nine more heaven path dao marks. The grand tribulation that sent Shi Zong into despair, turned into heaven path dao marks, amounts to nine. A normal grand tribulation would give less than nine. Fang Yuan estimates around seven.",
